msgctxt "108"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Hey, doc. Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "The boy! What did the boy eat before he collapsed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "That was just around lunchtime, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Haruka. What did you guys have for lunch today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Soba! We got them from a noodle shop a few blocks away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Just as I thought. The blood tests I ran showed extremely\r\n"
"high allergen levels, meaning Taichi's attack was in fact\r\n"
"due to an allergic reaction to whatever he had for lunch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "In other words... buckwheat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Taichi did keep talking about how good it was. He probably\r\n"
"ate twice as much as the other kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "I guess that means he can't have soba anymore, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"It would be prudent to avoid it, yes. As with any severe\r\n"
"allergic reaction, it could cause his airways to swell up,\r\n"
"greatly restricting his ability to breathe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"In extreme cases, he may even go into anaphylactic shock.\r\n"
"It's difficult to overstate just how dangerous this could\r\n"
"potentially be for your boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "I had no idea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"But if we can take heart from something, it's the fact that\r\n"
"he ate an especially large amount of soba before collapsing.\r\n"
"It may be a mere minor allergy in regular quantities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"In some cases, people have even been known to grow out of\r\n"
"childhood food allergies as they mature. You simply never\r\n"
"know what the future may hold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"I must encourage caution, though. Nowadays it's very easy\r\n"
"to eat a food containing buckwheat without even realizing\r\n"
"it's one of the ingredients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"I imagine he won't mind very much, though. It seems Taichi\r\n"
"would gladly give up soba if it means he's able to wrestle\r\n"
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "How's he looking, doc?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Hmmm. From what I can tell, it seems to be a severe case of asthma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "But he's never shown any signs of it before. How is that possible?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"It's difficult to say before further tests, but there are\r\n"
"countless possible reasons for the sudden onset."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"It could be mere genetics, or perhaps caused by something\r\n"
"from the environment. Cigarette smoke, pollution, what have\r\n"
"you. There are other possibilities beyond that as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Ngh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Whaddya mean, \"other possibilities\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Well you see, kids these days are subject to a much higher level of stress "
"than we were back in the day. Not only that, but this child is an orphan, "
"yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Yeah, but..."
msgstr "Sì, ma..."

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"This is simple conjecture, but this could be arising now as\r\n"
"a result of the great stress Taichi must have gone through\r\n"
"as a young boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"He may still be a child, but I suspect there are traumatic\r\n"
"experiences hiding just under the surface."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "And that can seriously cause asthma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"It's entirely possible. In any case, strenuous exercise is off the table "
"from now on. We can say with near complete certainty that wrestling was the "
"cause of this attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"There are no \"buts\" to this, sir! Your child's health is at\r\n"
"serious risk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Risk? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Affonderà? Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"The potential complications of asthma reach far beyond the coughing and "
"shortness of breath so often associated with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"If left untreated, this could very well become a chronic issue for your boy."
" He may someday be unable to breathe on his own. Worst case scenario, it may"
" ultimately be fatal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"So, for the time being I would suggest he take it easy and\r\n"
"avoid exercise of any kind until we have the test results."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "I had no idea this was so serious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"Does this mean Taichi's gonna have to stop wrestling?\r\n"
"It'll break his heart..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Well, let's not go jumpin' to any conclusions before we get\r\n"
"those test results, yeah? I'm gonna go check on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "(Guess I'll go, too. It'd be good to cheer him up somehow...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"Ugh, if I have to hear another word about Tokyo, I think I'm gonna puke-yo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Me, too. I dunno how Ayako-chan and Riona are still so into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"Guess girls like hearing about the big city or something. I wish Uncle Kaz "
"talked about wrestling matches in Tokyo instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "I bet they show them on TV up there every single night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "Uh... Maybe not <Italic>every</Italic> night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"How would you know, huh!? You're not the expert on Tokyo wrestling all of a "
"sudden, Mitsuo! You've never even been there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Well, neither have you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Grrr, shut up! Let's settle this in the ring!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "But we wrestle all the time! Can't we do something else for once?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Come onnn! Let's just go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "...Fine. But go easy on me this time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Yeah, yeah! Whatever you say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "Uncle Kaz? Have you seen Taichi around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"I saw him run off to the beach with Mitsuo just now. Why,\r\n"
"what's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"It's his turn to do the shopping today, but he still hasn't\r\n"
"gone. Can you go talk some sense into him for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Sure, just a second."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "(All Taichi ever does is play...)"
msgstr ""

